Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:07:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] NTimeHierarchy: the status text, the setup's
 implementation paragraph, three sketches

The decider's docstring is restored and names the interpreter core as its
only open dependency; the module status and the universal NDTM's docstring
describe the proved setup; proof sketches for the canonizer halt, the bank
erase and the input rewind. Three index-arithmetic steps use simp only with
the Fin coercion lemmas; unused simp arguments and no-op push_casts dropped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
